      "sourceTextSha256": "014cddde81599856030470ef735c3515a3c6b5a68c671ffb8e2aab0509ec6262",
      "text": "An early 45-minute flight to Palmar Sur, where your nature guide meets you. A boat trip down the Sierpe River through mangrove wetlands takes you to Rancho Corcovado, where a welcome cocktail awaits before lunch.\n\nThe afternoon is free for nature trails, the beach or relaxation after the journey. Overnight at Rancho Corcovado.\n\nMeals: breakfast, lunch and dinner.",
